  "description": "Motobecane Mirage SLX-XTL: perfect for the entry-to-sport level rider wanting the performance of an aluminum frame, the comfort of a carbon fork, and a factory-direct sale price.\n\nXTL Brake Lever Upgrade: Extra brake levers mounted left and right of the stem give quicker, easier braking from the bar-top position. Riders say they are especially useful in traffic, hazardous situations, and stop-and-go riding.\n\n2026 Features: Straight Blade Carbon forks for precise and comfortable riding Semi-Compact aluminum frame with replaceable rear derailleur hanger and 2 bottle mounts Shimano Claris STI 3x8 speed drivetrain with triple cranks for more hill-crushing range Aluminum dual-pivot brake calipers Shimano front and rear derailleurs Weinmann DP18 aero-section double-wall aluminum wheelset Factory-packed FREE road pedals as shown\n\nCompare to: Trek or Specialized carbon fork road bikes with Shimano STI shifters at $1100+.",
